# DOL Starter Test I/O Tags Configuration

## Test Digital Inputs (Module: DI_16x24VDC, Address: 4)
| Tag Name | Address | Data Type | Description | Comment |
|----------|---------|-----------|-------------|---------|
| DI_Test_Start_PB | %I4.0 | BOOL | Test start button simulation | Test input |
| DI_Test_Stop_PB | %I4.1 | BOOL | Test stop button simulation | Test input |
| DI_Test_Overload | %I4.2 | BOOL | Test overload simulation | Test input |
| DI_Test_Contactor_FB | %I4.3 | BOOL | Test contactor feedback simulation | Test input |
| DI_Test_Mode_Enable | %I4.4 | BOOL | Test mode enable selector | Mode select |
| DI_Manual_Contactor_Test | %I4.5 | BOOL | Manual contactor test | Manual test |
| DI_Reset_Test | %I4.6 | BOOL | Reset test results | Test reset |

## Test Digital Outputs (Module: DQ_16x24VDC, Address: 4)
| Tag Name | Address | Data Type | Description | Comment |
|----------|---------|-----------|-------------|---------|
| DQ_Sim_Start_PB | %Q4.0 | BOOL | Simulated start to DOL starter | Test output |
| DQ_Sim_Stop_PB | %Q4.1 | BOOL | Simulated stop to DOL starter | Test output |
| DQ_Sim_Overload | %Q4.2 | BOOL | Simulated overload to DOL starter | Test output |
| DQ_Sim_Aux_Contact | %Q4.3 | BOOL | Simulated aux contact to DOL starter | Test output |
| DQ_Test_Mode_Active | %Q4.4 | BOOL | Test mode indicator | Status indicator |
| DQ_Test_Contactor_Out | %Q4.5 | BOOL | Manual test contactor output | Test output |

## Test Verification Outputs (Module: DQ_16x24VDC, Address: 5)
| Tag Name | Address | Data Type | Description | Comment |
|----------|---------|-----------|-------------|---------|
| DQ_Running_Verified | %Q5.0 | BOOL | Running status verified | Test result |
| DQ_Fault_Verified | %Q5.1 | BOOL | Fault status verified | Test result |
| DQ_Ready_Verified | %Q5.2 | BOOL | Ready status verified | Test result |
| DQ_Test_Success | %Q5.3 | BOOL | Test passed indication | Test result |
| DQ_Test_Fail | %Q5.4 | BOOL | Test failed indication | Test result |

## HMI Test Tags
| Tag Name | Data Type | Description | Access |
|----------|-----------|-------------|--------|
| Test_Enable | BOOL | Enable test mode from HMI | Read/Write |
| Test_Start_Command | BOOL | HMI test start button | Read/Write |
| Test_Stop_Command | BOOL | HMI test stop button | Read/Write |
| Test_Overload_Command | BOOL | HMI test overload simulation | Read/Write |
| Test_Contactor_FB_Command | BOOL | HMI test contactor feedback | Read/Write |
| Test_Reset_Command | BOOL | HMI reset test results | Read/Write |
| Test_Mode_Status | BOOL | Test mode active status | Read Only |
| Test_Pass_Status | BOOL | Test passed status | Read Only |
| Test_Fail_Status | BOOL | Test failed status | Read Only |
| Test_Counter | INT | Test execution counter | Read Only |

## Test Data Block Tags (for HMI access)
| Tag Name | Path | Data Type | Description |
|----------|------|-----------|-------------|
| Test_1.Start_Test | "DOL_Starter_Test_Instance".bStart_Test_Pass | BOOL | Start test pass |
| Test_1.Stop_Test | "DOL_Starter_Test_Instance".bStop_Test_Pass | BOOL | Stop test pass |
| Test_1.Overload_Test | "DOL_Starter_Test_Instance".bOverload_Test_Pass | BOOL | Overload test pass |
| Test_1.Feedback_Test | "DOL_Starter_Test_Instance".bFeedback_Test_Pass | BOOL | Feedback test pass |
| Test_1.Counter | "DOL_Starter_Test_Instance".iTest_Counter | INT | Test counter |
| Test_1.Result_Latch | "DOL_Starter_Test_Instance".bTest_Result_Latch | BOOL | Test result latch |

## Test Alarm Tags
| Tag Name | Data Type | Trigger Condition | Priority |
|----------|-----------|-------------------|----------|
| Test_Start_Fail | BOOL | Start test failed | Medium |
| Test_Stop_Fail | BOOL | Stop test failed | Medium |
| Test_Overload_Fail | BOOL | Overload test failed | High |
| Test_Feedback_Fail | BOOL | Feedback test failed | High |
| Test_Timeout | BOOL | Test execution timeout | High |

## Test Monitoring Tags
| Tag Name | Data Type | Description | Update Rate |
|----------|-----------|-------------|-------------|
| Test_Cycle_Time | TIME | Test execution cycle time | 100ms |
| Test_Last_Execution | DT | Last test execution timestamp | On change |
| Test_Duration | TIME | Total test duration | On change |
| Test_Success_Rate | REAL | Test success percentage | On change |

## Symbolic Names (TIA Portal)
### Test Input Symbols
```
"Test_Start_PB" : %I4.0
"Test_Stop_PB" : %I4.1
"Test_Overload" : %I4.2
"Test_Contactor_FB" : %I4.3
"Test_Mode_Enable" : %I4.4
"Manual_Contactor_Test" : %I4.5
"Reset_Test" : %I4.6
```

### Test Output Symbols
```
"Sim_Start_PB" : %Q4.0
"Sim_Stop_PB" : %Q4.1
"Sim_Overload" : %Q4.2
"Sim_Aux_Contact" : %Q4.3
"Test_Mode_Active" : %Q4.4
"Test_Contactor_Out" : %Q4.5
```

### Test Verification Symbols
```
"Running_Verified" : %Q5.0
"Fault_Verified" : %Q5.1
"Ready_Verified" : %Q5.2
"Test_Success" : %Q5.3
"Test_Fail" : %Q5.4
```

## Address Allocation Notes
- Test inputs start at %I4.0 (after main DOL starter inputs)
- Test outputs start at %Q4.0 (after main DOL starter outputs)
- Verification outputs at %Q5.0
- Reserve addresses %I4.0-%I4.6 for test inputs
- Reserve addresses %Q4.0-%Q4.5 for test outputs
- Reserve addresses %Q5.0-%Q5.4 for verification outputs

## Test Mode Security Tags
| Tag Name | Data Type | Description | Security Level |
|----------|-----------|-------------|----------------|
| Test_Authorization | BOOL | Test mode authorization required | High |
| Test_Password_Valid | BOOL | Test password validation | High |
| Test_User_Level | INT | Test user access level | High |
| Test_Audit_Log | STRING[100] | Test audit log entry | Medium |

## Test Configuration Tags
| Tag Name | Data Type | Description | Default Value |
|----------|-----------|-------------|---------------|
| Test_Auto_Mode | BOOL | Enable automated test sequence | FALSE |
| Test_Loop_Mode | BOOL | Enable continuous test loop | FALSE |
| Test_Delay_Time | TIME | Delay between test steps | T#1S |
| Test_Retry_Count | INT | Number of test retries | 3 |
| Test_Timeout_Value | TIME | Test execution timeout | T#10S |

## Test Documentation Tags
| Tag Name | Data Type | Description |
|----------|-----------|-------------|
| Test_Procedure_Name | STRING[50] | Current test procedure name |
| Test_Step_Number | INT | Current test step number |
| Test_Step_Description | STRING[100] | Current test step description |
| Test_Expected_Result | STRING[100] | Expected test result |
| Test_Actual_Result | STRING[100] | Actual test result |
| Test_Comments | STRING[200] | Test comments and notes |

